<i>in a row that he's been here.</i>

12
00:00:50,217 --> 00:00:51,853
<i>And what's he doing now?</i>

13
00:00:51,953 --> 00:00:54,187
<i>He's sitting in his car.</i>

14
00:00:54,923 --> 00:00:56,724
<i>Can you tell me how long</i>
<i>he's been out there?</i>

15
00:00:56,824 --> 00:00:58,626
No, I don't know how
long he's been out there.

16
00:00:58,726 --> 00:01:00,628
<i>And what's your</i>
<i>ex-husband wearing?</i>

17
00:01:00,728 --> 00:01:02,630
<i>I don't know.
</i> <i>I can't see him.</i>

18
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:03,698
