32
00:02:10,397 --> 00:02:12,165
<i>Yeah, I know. Me too.</i>

33
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,434
You don't even know
if it was him.

34
00:02:14,535 --> 00:02:16,037
<i>Trust me, it was him.</i>

35
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:17,404
